+#### Emptiness Loss on Weights
+- **Definition:** A ray regularization technique that applies emptiness loss to the NeRF weight $w_i$ [S2].
+- **Pitfall:** Fails because $w_i$ in NeRF is a biased geometry proxy [S2].
